  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eswatini PCB Project: PCB Use Phase Out and Elimination in Eswatini</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Reduced risks to human health and the environment through the phase-out and environmentally sound management (ESM) of PCB-containing equipment and waste in Eswatini. The project aims to ensure the elimination of PCB-containing equipment and waste in line with Stockholm Convention targets for 2025 and 2028. The project will focus on strengthening national policies and regulatory frameworks for PCB phase-out, compl</narrative>
  </description>
